#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:4
msgid "APK Starter"
msgstr "APK Starter"

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.desktop.in:3
#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:5
#: src/apk_starter/gui.py:544
msgid "Run Android apps on the Linux desktop"
msgstr "Esegui app Android sul desktop Linux"

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.desktop.in:4
msgid "Android;APK;App;"
msgstr "Android;APK;App;Applicazione;"

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"APK Starter runs a single Android app from its APK file on the Linux "
"desktop. It is built on Android Translation Layer (ATL) and translates the "
"app's calls to GTK, Wayland and the usual Linux libraries instead of running "
"a full Android system."
msgstr ""
"APK Starter esegue una singola app Android dal suo file APK sul desktop "
"Linux. Si basa su Android Translation Layer (ATL) e traduce le chiamate "
"dell’app verso GTK, Wayland e le comuni librerie Linux, invece di eseguire "
"un sistema Android completo."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"Bring your own APK: open it, double-click it, or add it to the application "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Porta il tuo APK: aprilo, fai doppio clic oppure aggiungilo al menu delle "
"applicazioni."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"A small window lists your apps with icon, version and data size; start, "
"uninstall or delete their data from there."
msgstr ""
"Una piccola finestra elenca le tue app con icona, versione e dimensione dei "
"dati; da lì puoi avviarle, disinstallarle o eliminarne i dati."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Each app keeps its own data folder."
msgstr "Ogni app ha la propria cartella dei dati."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"Apps can read and write your Downloads folder and read, but not change, your "
"Pictures, Music and Videos folders, for example for their own gallery or "
"music player."
msgstr "Le app possono leggere e scrivere la tua cartella Download e leggere, ma non modificare, le tue cartelle Immagini, Musica e Video, ad esempio per la propria galleria o il proprio lettore musicale."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:24
msgid ""
"Debug records an app to find out why it does not work; the archive is "
"cleaned of personal data."
msgstr ""
"Debug registra un'app per capire perché non funziona; l'archivio è ripulito "
"dai dati personali."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:26
msgid ""
"No apps are included and no Google services are provided. Apps that need "
"Google Play services, Jetpack Compose, ARM-only native code, the camera, "
"Bluetooth or telephony may not work."
msgstr ""
"Non sono incluse app né servizi Google. Le app che richiedono i servizi "
"Google Play, Jetpack Compose, codice nativo solo ARM, la fotocamera, il "
"Bluetooth o la telefonia potrebbero non funzionare."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:30
msgid "Android is a trademark of Google LLC."
msgstr "Android è un marchio di Google LLC."

#: data/io.github.Jimbambuli.ApkStarter.metainfo.xml.in:31
msgid ""
"The Android robot in the icon is reproduced or modified from work created "
"and shared by Google and used according to terms described in the Creative "
"Commons 3.0 Attribution License."
msgstr ""
"Il robot Android nell’icona è riprodotto o modificato a partire da un’opera "
"creata e condivisa da Google e viene usato secondo i termini della licenza "
"Creative Commons Attribuzione 3.0."

